    {
      "name": "5. Cart & Save Order (2 APIs Linked by ID) (POST)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Cart Stock & Items Check (Returns cart_id & delivery rates)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (jsonData.status && jsonData.data && jsonData.data.cart_id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('cart_id', jsonData.data.cart_id);",
                  "    console.log('Saved cart_id: ' + jsonData.data.cart_id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"product_id\": 18,\n      \"qty\": 2,\n      \"variant_id\": null,\n      \"product_variant_id\": null,\n      \"unit_total\": 36.0\n    }\n  ],\n  \"currency\": \"{{currency}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/cart-details",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "cart-details"
              ]
            },
            "description": "API 1 of 2 (Cart & Items Verification):\n- Mobile app sends local cart items and user selected currency (e.g. 'bdt_rate' or 'BDT').\n- Notice: unit_total is provided from the body for each item (e.g. qty * unit_price). The API calculates subtotal based on each item's unit_total.\n- Notice: place_type is REMOVED from this request!\n- Checks stock for each product & variant.\n- If ANY product stock < cart qty, halts and returns status: false with errors array showing which products cannot be fulfilled.\n- If ALL products are in stock, stores items in DB with unique cart_id.\n- Automatically calculates BOTH inside_city and outside_city delivery charges in the selected currency (product delivery charges + vendor settings + item weight).\n- Returns cart_id, sub_total, delivery_charges { inside_city, outside_city }, currency, currency_symbol, and available payment methods."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Save Order (Checkout - Follows payshop_ecm_modify)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (jsonData.status && jsonData.data && jsonData.data.order_id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('order_id', jsonData.data.order_id.toString());",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('invoice_no', jsonData.data.invoice_no);",
                  "    console.log('Saved order_id: ' + jsonData.data.order_id + ', invoice: ' + jsonData.data.invoice_no);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"cart_id\": \"{{cart_id}}\",\n  \"user_id\": \"{{user_id}}\",\n  \"user_name\": \"Rahim Khan\",\n  \"user_phone\": \"01700123456\",\n  \"user_email\": \"rahim@example.com\",\n  \"user_country\": \"Bangladesh\",\n  \"user_city\": \"Dhaka\",\n  \"user_zipcode\": \"1213\",\n  \"user_address\": \"House 10, Road 4, Banani\",\n  \"place_type\": \"inside_city\",\n  \"currency\": \"{{currency}}\",\n  \"payment_method_id\": 1\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/save-order",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "save-order"
              ]
            },
            "description": "API 2 of 2 (Save Order Checkout Submission):\n- Follows payshop_ecm_modify checkout form.\n- place_type: 'inside_city' or 'outside_city' (passed from body).\n- currency: 'bdt_rate' (passed from body).\n- NOTICE: Client does NOT send delivery_charge! Backend automatically calculates delivery_charge based on place_type in user's currency.\n- Identifies the ordered items via cart_id.\n- Inserts Order into 'orders' table (INV-00...) with place_type, delivery_charge, subtotal, and total in selected currency.\n- Inserts each ordered item into 'order_details' table with place_type ('inside_city' or 'outside_city'), vendor delivery charge, and vendor price.\n- Decrements stock in 'products' and 'product_variants'.\n- Clears temporary cart records from DB."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
